{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "Below is a clean, structured rewrite suitable for a blog post.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/eed8848c937b7bbad59faf12864c27c1efaa22e97bd51de39b9d5f804ea8c11e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.82], [4, 1.0, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.8], [6, 1.8, 2.16], [7, 2.16, 2.46], [8, 2.46, 2.54], [9, 2.54, 2.74], [10, 2.74, 3.2]]}, {"text": "I’ve preserved your intent, simplified the narrative, and tightened the logic so it reads as practical guidance rather than a personal rant, while still grounding it in real experience.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a56fafd5acabc181f7c90e9a162718372b848cecae6af4b6abc43d4bc92c7fe3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.64], [2, 0.64, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.22], [5, 2.18, 2.38], [6, 2.38, 2.74], [7, 3.38, 3.48], [9, 3.78, 3.98], [10, 3.98, 4.26], [11, 4.26, 4.56], [12, 4.56, 4.68], [13, 4.68, 4.88], [15, 5.04, 5.44], [16, 5.44, 5.86], [17, 5.86, 6.28], [18, 6.28, 6.5], [19, 6.5, 6.56], [20, 6.56, 6.94], [21, 6.94, 7.28], [22, 7.86, 8.04], [23, 8.04, 8.32], [24, 8.32, 8.7], [25, 8.7, 8.94], [26, 8.94, 9.06], [27, 9.06, 9.24], [28, 9.24, 9.86]]}, {"text": "When people talk about “account security,” they often jump straight to advanced tools, expensive subscriptions, or overly complex setups.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1e099cd7d511a21465247758249ced6d651b09e6b84013629f91482db55cb49d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.14], [5, 1.14, 1.74], [7, 2.36, 2.64], [8, 2.64, 2.86], [9, 2.86, 3.22], [10, 3.22, 3.44], [11, 3.44, 3.76], [12, 3.76, 4.22], [13, 4.46, 4.84], [14, 4.84, 5.54], [15, 5.94, 6.22], [16, 6.22, 6.64], [17, 6.64, 7.08], [18, 7.08, 7.54]]}, {"text": "In reality, the biggest risks to your personal accounts-especially financial ones, come from a few very predictable failure modes.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1836fad4b1b487997aa110806da9d1bae4585303c25f00d75a54146b795ddb7c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.62], [2, 1.16, 1.24], [3, 1.24, 1.46], [4, 1.46, 1.84], [5, 1.84, 2.1], [6, 2.1, 2.26], [7, 2.26, 2.64], [9, 3.72, 4.24], [10, 4.24, 4.62], [11, 5.0, 5.12], [12, 5.12, 5.28], [13, 5.28, 5.4], [14, 5.4, 5.56], [15, 5.56, 5.8], [16, 5.8, 6.18], [17, 6.18, 6.6], [18, 6.6, 6.86]]}, {"text": "My goal is not perfect security.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6a7eaec8f36ad18313f2e0c6e38073bfba2f88054417f83871f01f4e6cd44fd0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 0.86], [4, 0.86, 1.22], [5, 1.22, 1.84]]}, {"text": "My goal is cheap, boring, resilient security that works even when things go wrong: providers make mistakes, phones get lost, or I cross borders and change SIM cards.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5cafde640199e0ae560b86084724dd7951e93e780176dd57f4afcdecf58263f5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.76], [3, 0.76, 1.12], [4, 1.5, 1.66], [5, 1.94, 2.32], [6, 2.32, 2.88], [7, 2.88, 3.1], [8, 3.1, 3.3], [9, 3.3, 3.66], [10, 3.66, 3.84], [11, 3.84, 4.1], [12, 4.1, 4.3], [13, 4.3, 4.74], [14, 5.22, 5.66], [15, 5.66, 5.8], [16, 5.8, 6.2], [18, 6.7, 6.94], [19, 6.94, 7.2], [21, 7.48, 7.56], [22, 7.56, 7.84], [23, 7.84, 8.2], [24, 8.2, 8.5], [25, 8.5, 8.86], [27, 9.08, 9.34]]}, {"text": "Here’s the simple system I use to protect my most sensitive accounts.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f880803707bd7c0e612a5644acb8ae697479093f56c945fc264ac8bf7bc05337.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.46], [1, 0.46, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.82], [3, 0.82, 1.22], [4, 1.22, 1.46], [5, 1.46, 1.74], [6, 1.74, 1.92], [7, 1.92, 2.16], [8, 2.16, 2.44], [9, 2.44, 2.72], [10, 2.72, 3.18], [11, 3.18, 3.62]]}, {"text": "1.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/78f576d89fbf848a360c8abe09de0769d439d7a299bcec69536c1db5b28e3993.mp3"}, {"text": "A Private Email Address I Fully Control", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/fc50a8843c0e050e9b2b1bd0c3d58832827b1eef54aebc60cc4e1bfb3ee89c9b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.76], [3, 0.76, 1.12], [4, 1.12, 1.32], [5, 1.32, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 1.94]]}, {"text": "My most important accounts, banks, brokerages, crypto exchanges, tax portals, are all tied to a single, private email address that I never use anywhere else.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5a554de0f5d852943a734ff098b90f32e7cabcb9179e0152509a743ba85ee122.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.9], [3, 0.9, 1.28], [5, 2.28, 2.74], [6, 3.04, 3.24], [7, 3.24, 3.7], [8, 4.0, 4.16], [9, 4.16, 4.64], [10, 4.64, 5.06], [11, 5.06, 5.26], [12, 5.26, 5.62], [13, 5.62, 5.88], [16, 6.24, 6.68], [17, 6.68, 7.0], [18, 7.0, 7.38], [19, 7.38, 7.64], [20, 7.64, 7.72], [21, 7.72, 7.94], [22, 7.94, 8.26], [23, 8.26, 8.64], [24, 8.64, 9.06]]}, {"text": "Why this matters", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/19bdefd9450e81eddd35cb79d84bb0a6e2e2396b65e7e693800f260d3b1f636e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.76]]}, {"text": "There are two major risks with “normal” email usage:", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/cde0977bb1e416f24d4ebbef3a9121a14d547b639cb742acba2b844d6b43c10b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.82], [4, 0.82, 1.2], [5, 1.2, 1.44], [6, 1.44, 1.8], [7, 1.8, 2.26], [8, 2.26, 2.68]]}, {"text": "Provider lockout If Google, Yahoo, or Microsoft decides (correctly or incorrectly) that your account violated a policy or triggered fraud detection, you can be locked out.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/be3a76af3d0c40a39828dbeb7e9ae0eea7eb19e1b581450eb2d04ff0907ac607.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.44], [1, 0.44, 1.04], [2, 1.32, 1.52], [3, 1.52, 1.82], [4, 2.04, 2.14], [6, 2.62, 2.9], [8, 4.08, 4.4], [9, 4.4, 4.76], [10, 4.76, 5.36], [12, 5.94, 6.08], [13, 6.08, 6.38], [14, 6.38, 6.86], [15, 6.86, 7.06], [16, 7.06, 7.52], [17, 7.52, 7.74], [18, 7.74, 8.1], [19, 8.1, 8.4], [20, 8.4, 8.88], [21, 9.18, 9.42], [22, 9.42, 9.58], [23, 9.58, 9.72], [24, 9.72, 9.9], [25, 9.9, 10.24]]}, {"text": "Losing access to your email is annoying.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/893101a9655d5572c23bbe5ee49bd9599e8504cd272289f86749c4bad641c017.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.62], [2, 0.62, 0.9], [3, 0.9, 1.0], [4, 1.0, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 1.86]]}, {"text": "Losing access to your financial accounts because your email is locked is catastrophic.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/003dd766590d077a4331d575703d75df950015757dbe6c73f5fe0124db074569.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.72], [2, 0.72, 0.98], [3, 0.98, 1.06], [4, 1.06, 1.38], [5, 1.38, 1.84], [6, 1.84, 2.08], [7, 2.08, 2.26], [8, 2.26, 2.56], [9, 2.56, 2.8], [10, 2.8, 3.0], [11, 3.0, 3.28], [12, 3.28, 3.76]]}, {"text": "Targeted attacks after data leaks Data breaches are inevitable.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4997296c5eaf278bff644d2aba5a64e2b32b77be5b369a597d77358260d607d4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.5], [1, 0.5, 0.8], [2, 0.8, 1.24], [3, 1.24, 1.48], [4, 1.48, 1.86], [5, 2.36, 2.54], [6, 2.54, 2.9], [7, 2.9, 3.16], [8, 3.16, 3.56]]}, {"text": "When an email address appears in enough leaks, attackers can infer:", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/aef331c995f051c66b9656b738530a492d338a629b3676327bcff0414c681e7d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.26], [5, 1.26, 1.5], [6, 1.5, 1.74], [7, 1.74, 2.22], [8, 2.54, 2.92], [9, 2.92, 3.14], [10, 3.14, 3.4]]}, {"text": "“This is probably the email used for important accounts.”", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/56fd471c1c057b4d50771c56cbb9c2fca1f6dac13fb0db21cfb6ae0872d540bc.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.1], [4, 1.1, 1.32], [6, 1.68, 1.82], [7, 1.82, 2.14], [8, 2.14, 2.44]]}, {"text": "I want attackers to not even know which email I use to authenticate money-related services, because they could leverage this in phishing emails.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/cbc88189e45e49a778b02efc0a09542a98e95dca05b8f494c44a2afd0f561d70.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.16], [5, 1.16, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 1.62], [7, 1.62, 1.94], [8, 1.94, 2.28], [9, 2.28, 2.6], [10, 2.6, 2.86], [11, 2.86, 3.08], [12, 3.08, 3.6], [14, 4.2, 4.78], [15, 4.78, 5.46], [17, 5.6, 5.72], [18, 5.72, 5.98], [19, 5.98, 6.28], [20, 6.28, 6.52], [21, 6.52, 6.82], [22, 6.82, 7.16]]}, {"text": "My solution", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ffa792b412be9fc7e743ffc1e38b7494a02fdd7bdf0f58e5822230bdbb2139ba.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.82]]}, {"text": "I own a custom domain", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/57645c6cfae794df22d834a4ce6c1a745a6c86d83b02f20dd28cf00df3e94b34.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.82], [4, 0.82, 1.18]]}, {"text": "I use a single, plain email address on that domain (no dots, or +wildcards)", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b1f9e824d63a896078521d1d28eb0aed0e79b01857cca4dc9a22df5ddeec7f31.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.44], [3, 0.44, 0.76], [5, 1.16, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 2.04], [7, 2.04, 2.38], [8, 2.38, 2.6], [9, 2.6, 2.94], [10, 3.46, 3.58], [11, 3.58, 3.84], [12, 3.84, 4.16], [13, 4.44, 5.0]]}, {"text": "That address is only used for financial and identity-critical services", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d69faedabb652eed66b74990d60304fc8f8001d410a7c36a5af86d88d27a04ad.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 1.0], [4, 1.0, 1.38], [5, 1.38, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 2.1], [7, 2.1, 2.4], [9, 3.16, 3.7]]}, {"text": "Even though the email is currently hosted on Google, I can move it to another provider at any time without changing the email address itself.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b0772752a81f36e82bb19a170b1d7443ac4dc5d5410d2e6c2424d518e183d9cd.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.44], [3, 0.44, 0.68], [4, 0.68, 0.82], [5, 0.82, 1.06], [6, 1.06, 1.5], [7, 1.5, 1.7], [8, 1.7, 1.98], [9, 2.44, 2.62], [10, 2.62, 2.74], [11, 2.74, 2.94], [12, 2.94, 3.06], [13, 3.06, 3.16], [14, 3.16, 3.38], [15, 3.38, 3.88], [16, 3.88, 4.16], [17, 4.16, 4.4], [18, 4.4, 4.78], [19, 4.78, 5.1], [20, 5.1, 5.46], [21, 5.46, 5.68], [22, 5.68, 5.92], [23, 5.92, 6.22], [24, 6.22, 6.6]]}, {"text": "That means:", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/01b49b8216bc9bed5690413ebe1e906c0727c254322a76ead4eddf89b06806b4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.94]]}, {"text": "I keep control", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d57ab76973a17b727d8e70daa2251bd96a726a77e55a855aee0563505fa6285d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.8]]}, {"text": "I avoid provider lock-in", "block": 18, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4af9e686f74b94c5dee1dc3928f34ef08f8e46307c85be6b94712853ca2f9235.mp3"}, {"text": "I can recover quickly if something goes wrong", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f9f948315300a924d177686397e1eb8facbb3473fc4f4e939cf29532c50922bf.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 1.84], [7, 1.84, 2.12]]}, {"text": "As a bonus, because this email is used so sparingly, if it ever shows up in a breach or spam list, I know exactly which service leaked it.", "block": 20, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2c4a3515df563aad3869dac7e3536c1de2a1b5c15ae141b57df1188f21df1bef.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.62], [4, 1.0, 1.28], [5, 1.28, 1.6], [6, 1.6, 1.84], [7, 1.84, 2.14], [8, 2.14, 2.46], [9, 2.46, 3.14], [10, 3.42, 3.62], [11, 3.62, 3.74], [12, 3.74, 3.92], [13, 3.92, 4.14], [14, 4.14, 4.38], [15, 4.38, 4.56], [16, 4.56, 4.66], [17, 4.66, 4.88], [18, 4.88, 5.14], [19, 5.14, 5.4], [20, 5.4, 5.64], [21, 6.0, 6.14], [22, 6.14, 6.26], [23, 6.26, 6.7], [24, 6.7, 6.96], [25, 6.96, 7.32], [26, 7.32, 7.68], [27, 7.68, 7.92]]}, {"text": "2.", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/20cdd1f7c4628f818caf2ac85845671d72c027445c17e3379dadbb121d28750b.mp3"}, {"text": "A Cross-Platform Password Manager (Not Platform Lock-In)", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/0fa04ed5bbf6b1160ec0c3474c35951b5bfa3040840acc00fdc340f23fdd5a29.mp3"}, {"text": "The second pillar is a proper password manager.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1af79b08bc5b70dbf0a058acee9511526c04a86e23663cd5b78286a76d185e72.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.76], [3, 0.76, 1.0], [4, 1.0, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.36], [6, 1.36, 1.88], [7, 1.88, 2.3]]}, {"text": "I personally use Bitwarden.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7149e8da8790e18a3891073f66de97fb48f9572c6d2c2e2004bea43d49ff9594.mp3"}, {"text": "Why a password manager is non-negotiable", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6280ae89c3e83d47cdc6bb462ef91aafce2124180197822404bc2d700b257375.mp3"}, {"text": "Every account gets a unique, long password", "block": 24, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ec66c0a15cc5d5118d197ba04ab93a38d9d2e14bfdfcfbfd9e86fb0f95efc7b5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.58], [2, 0.58, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 0.98], [4, 0.98, 1.32], [5, 1.56, 1.76], [6, 1.76, 2.22]]}, {"text": "Passwords sync across:", "block": 25, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/68c6cb1ca5b15ad305206777762dd5b55e2aa50dd40c560666f30921957a6eba.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.7], [2, 1.14, 1.44]]}, {"text": "Firefox and Chrome", "block": 26, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/cf9c0cea74d4cf21a00a04be1fc76e624650d1b39aa30e6887797162a6b5fb1e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.5], [1, 0.5, 0.9], [2, 0.9, 1.22]]}, {"text": "macOS, Windows, iOS, Android", "block": 27, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7c000ee8d89db4da4b6c8434b1975b7b42a8d3ab08ef79ad23da3f20638b481f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.62], [1, 0.96, 1.32], [2, 1.7, 1.98], [3, 2.5, 2.84]]}, {"text": "I am not tied to a single ecosystem", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f0bc7a5c6ddceb6458896f3ca367d68cb20f6751239343a29c8e70ea8562dfbb.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.26], [2, 0.26, 0.46], [3, 0.46, 0.7], [4, 0.7, 0.92], [5, 0.92, 1.04], [6, 1.04, 1.26], [7, 1.26, 1.76]]}, {"text": "I’ve watched friends switch phones or platforms and suddenly lose years of saved passwords because everything lived inside Apple Keychain or a browser profile.", "block": 29, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c86fd6b57417212ada437d89f8871bd5d2d72ba149e848c372f2655652939042.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 0.98], [4, 0.98, 1.36], [5, 1.36, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 2.04], [7, 2.04, 2.36], [8, 2.36, 2.7], [9, 2.7, 3.0], [10, 3.0, 3.36], [11, 3.36, 3.62], [13, 3.9, 4.4], [14, 4.4, 4.8], [15, 4.8, 5.28], [16, 5.28, 5.64], [17, 5.64, 6.16], [18, 6.16, 6.56], [19, 6.56, 7.08], [20, 7.08, 7.34], [22, 7.34, 7.66], [23, 7.66, 8.18]]}, {"text": "Recovering from that is painful and risky.", "block": 29, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/92cd5d7ef4f6919ede29e496ca56a51e2422df4b43352134932ecc39f7c3c9c1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.48], [1, 0.48, 0.58], [2, 0.58, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 0.98], [4, 0.98, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.78], [6, 1.78, 2.12]]}, {"text": "With a dedicated password manager:", "block": 30, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/9f6f4921c204ff6f119482b4774bf319c03f0c109c0ac274ad22818243914733.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.38], [4, 1.38, 1.86]]}, {"text": "Switching devices is trivial", "block": 31, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e17bec86bbb407011f9b6f5d817add918a66fe4a1d9c6483b7f1b3b7d4581e1c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [1, 0.4, 0.7], [2, 0.7, 1.3], [3, 1.3, 1.82]]}, {"text": "Losing a device is annoying, but not life-ending", "block": 32, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c1f8f6b8b1599420281b53114c6f59c229197aca8da01883455694c4896e5cf5.mp3"}, {"text": "Compromised passwords can be rotated quickly", "block": 33, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7bc2ba916e3ece8281bf91927a9615fe5fa0ca3fdf5198fe23a911c47835e56d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.58], [1, 0.58, 0.96], [2, 0.96, 1.18], [3, 1.18, 1.3], [4, 1.3, 1.68], [5, 1.68, 2.08]]}, {"text": "Bitwarden also integrates breach monitoring, so I can see if any credentials associated with me appear in known leaks.", "block": 34, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/da9697ae1dc4e3b87d9ffbb513adca401a1d19589184062b79398520206fe5c2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.58], [1, 0.58, 0.88], [2, 0.88, 1.52], [3, 1.52, 1.74], [4, 1.74, 2.28], [5, 2.28, 2.7], [6, 2.7, 2.8], [7, 2.8, 2.94], [8, 2.94, 3.14], [9, 3.14, 3.3], [10, 3.3, 3.46], [11, 3.46, 3.82], [12, 3.82, 4.54], [13, 4.54, 4.84], [14, 4.84, 4.98], [15, 4.98, 5.36], [16, 5.36, 5.54], [17, 5.54, 5.7], [18, 5.7, 5.98]]}, {"text": "There are excellent paid options (like 1Password), but I deliberately keep my monthly subscriptions low.", "block": 35, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/958b2cc56d6950bbcfe9e37840bfec7e81fb61f174125c534a79d4f6925800a7.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.48], [5, 1.7, 1.78], [7, 2.74, 2.82], [8, 2.82, 2.94], [9, 2.94, 3.36], [10, 3.36, 3.68], [11, 3.68, 3.84], [12, 3.84, 4.14], [13, 4.14, 4.64], [14, 4.64, 5.08]]}, {"text": "Bitwarden gives me what I need at zero cost.", "block": 35, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1c065c78fbbdae3e30cb2da6450c268dbe19b68f9cd0cceb3acbe079c1831de6.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.5, 0.66], [2, 0.66, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.0], [4, 1.0, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.28], [6, 1.28, 1.42], [7, 1.42, 1.66], [8, 1.66, 1.98]]}, {"text": "3.", "block": 36, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/49780f6cad3608ed7c1c70d7c65cae480614317a60df440e74334677de83472c.mp3"}, {"text": "Avoid SMS OTP Whenever Possible", "block": 36, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/9a4c50112d24937647aa1c02c480a22f71091853158ae68d30c96cb60d9f0bd6.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.38, 0.76], [2, 0.76, 1.4], [4, 2.0, 2.54]]}, {"text": "Passwords alone are not enough.", "block": 37, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8c6aca28051cad4c0aac3bb06150392ff985b53611604681fcf064dcb4f801e1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.52], [1, 0.52, 0.8], [2, 0.8, 1.06], [3, 1.06, 1.28], [4, 1.28, 1.52]]}, {"text": "Two-factor authentication (2FA) is critical, but how you do it matters.", "block": 37, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c5a1da7324d10cf5820b2f4186584005c0a704aa0d766b8c2f9036e597fdadd3.mp3"}, {"text": "Why I avoid SMS-based OTP", "block": 38, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5fa1766640fe7a49f5c7034e2792ba84732726c2ba568bbeb68d059ec8d0aab4.mp3"}, {"text": "SMS authentication fails in the real world:", "block": 39, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/26ae83a5e737aa4212abf433956d51a465bb87fc4c44dd51f9f9606b3b40dd5b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.52], [1, 0.52, 1.42], [2, 1.42, 1.84], [3, 1.84, 2.1], [4, 2.1, 2.2], [5, 2.2, 2.36], [6, 2.36, 2.76]]}, {"text": "Phone numbers change", "block": 40, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3079eb106efa8bb393ab5660e2c1be05d1b32618afa748b6974a0e0a6456ef07.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.9]]}, {"text": "SIM cards get lost", "block": 41, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3e76977c46081d7fa41825bea9da731edcb6ef4243fb22e92d299cd7e13b0072.mp3"}, {"text": "Messages don’t arrive while traveling", "block": 42, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c7d0f8226cd85b1ad49b2668a0fd204ce0a200e9606a2239bc8de9012bb57508.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.5], [1, 0.5, 0.78], [2, 0.78, 1.06], [3, 1.06, 1.36], [4, 1.36, 1.9]]}, {"text": "Accounts often outlive phone numbers", "block": 43, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/fc596ae292e69b4ff082a14a900629d8d458f043c339e2a92c834e9de489ad46.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.5], [1, 0.5, 0.74], [2, 0.74, 1.2], [3, 1.2, 1.44], [4, 1.44, 1.76]]}, {"text": "Your bank account should not depend on whether you currently have reception in a foreign country.", "block": 44, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/0a007d69b9a5fe7fc955e722cda5b766fce59de07e5be4d19111fb0ca457a98b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.12], [5, 1.12, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 1.66], [7, 1.66, 1.9], [8, 1.9, 2.08], [9, 2.08, 2.38], [10, 2.38, 2.64], [11, 2.64, 3.08], [12, 3.08, 3.36], [13, 3.36, 3.46], [14, 3.46, 3.66], [15, 3.66, 4.06]]}, {"text": "What I use instead", "block": 45, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/09f1075a841bcb346ede11f1d5f2c794068850b35e7e48794339ca442fb0f558.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.88]]}, {"text": "App-based authenticators whenever possible", "block": 46, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/cce51ab9fd019938473643c26fc2cd3bbc443f423a20542cc849f97e2c7bfa8b.mp3"}, {"text": "Google Authenticator (or equivalent)", "block": 47, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b78b8b7088302f216543817a734efe37bec0d2fdcb991657cf2c7fde14c2296d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 1.12], [3, 1.56, 2.0]]}, {"text": "Works offline", "block": 48, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c8415a56922ee3d4efe2989f240ca73fcbeaa1f08312172393469b47f4be3ac7.mp3"}, {"text": "Not tied to a phone number", "block": 49, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/de1c6af983aac290fc299b60a83c6584a0525a7bb7d98352dd2d85dfdd111354.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 0.86], [4, 0.86, 1.04], [5, 1.04, 1.34]]}, {"text": "Google Voice as a fallback", "block": 50, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e9ec46c98dc5f85c8c08ec6af5a14e981a656452694dc18f8a4e61eb45f49c19.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.64], [2, 0.64, 0.86], [3, 0.86, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.36]]}, {"text": "Used only when SMS OTP is unavoidable", "block": 51, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/87f1d31cfc87164a9134540abbf3da373df1825245b8797fcc93c0083e871271.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.26, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.82], [3, 0.82, 1.12], [4, 1.12, 1.64], [5, 1.64, 1.98], [6, 1.98, 2.56]]}, {"text": "Works internationally", "block": 52, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/58c183d5b2e83d18194c8018c80a667fc6cc01a5c4f2ee227c5ba5bd041b551a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.96]]}, {"text": "Reliable ~95–99% of the time", "block": 53, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a07a4f2efa38564b2c0e23fce89acf2cacb76145b6650e2cf0138d00dca954bf.mp3"}, {"text": "In rare cases where neither option works, I fall back to my long-term U.S. phone number, but I treat that as a last resort because it’s expensive and fragile while traveling.", "block": 54, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/802295e69bc34154ad6659de39ae5f4622998c197c677dab1b078115403257df.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.18], [5, 1.18, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 1.9], [7, 2.26, 2.32], [8, 2.32, 2.56], [9, 2.56, 2.76], [10, 2.76, 2.96], [11, 2.96, 3.08], [13, 3.62, 3.86], [14, 3.86, 4.14], [15, 4.14, 4.44], [16, 4.82, 4.96], [17, 4.96, 5.06], [18, 5.06, 5.26], [19, 5.26, 5.5], [20, 5.5, 5.76], [21, 5.76, 5.82], [22, 5.82, 6.0], [23, 6.0, 6.34], [24, 6.34, 6.62], [25, 6.62, 6.8], [26, 6.8, 7.24], [27, 7.24, 7.48], [28, 7.48, 7.86], [29, 7.86, 8.08], [30, 8.08, 8.48]]}, {"text": "4.", "block": 55, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/57e2c0882f4ed5b72af4037b86dc5b9a495ba8ca2cbc83ede3e1b2e84864ee1c.mp3"}, {"text": "Designing for Loss and Failure (Because It Will Happen)", "block": 55, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/511018188edc6a0c749b752ab62bc8cc934b52c2215220f60687a7e2e2716d57.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.5], [1, 0.5, 0.78], [2, 0.78, 1.0], [3, 1.0, 1.18], [4, 1.18, 1.52], [5, 1.52, 2.28], [6, 2.28, 2.46], [7, 2.46, 2.58], [8, 2.58, 2.92]]}, {"text": "A core principle of my setup is assuming that bad things will eventually happen:", "block": 56, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/814af52d2c95e27397c6c45004db5671273cbe2aa0c1d71121e390bd28666329.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.12], [1, 0.12, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 0.98], [4, 0.98, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.46], [6, 1.46, 1.7], [7, 1.7, 2.04], [8, 2.04, 2.26], [9, 2.26, 2.48], [10, 2.48, 2.74], [11, 2.74, 2.98], [12, 2.98, 3.4], [13, 3.4, 3.86]]}, {"text": "A phone gets stolen", "block": 57, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7cd658c3bff00ba1d3ed963db8c569abdba46dad6cd3d5484a745631c7c94c76.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 1.06]]}, {"text": "A laptop disappears", "block": 58, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/923ba10a5afe14dda19c615db37a2251aafb37896635dd7a511e4f851a86714e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 1.08]]}, {"text": "An email provider locks an account", "block": 59, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/79208941b8162c7be6e2d69775bd6ba61f45cb11c6181d7e79a977ff4848386c.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.18, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.92], [3, 0.92, 1.26], [4, 1.26, 1.5], [5, 1.5, 1.8]]}, {"text": "A service gets breached", "block": 60, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d352e0f0298b020b2a703ab9bf46a5fac516afe0d6ffb33b87e2628a8f5b91a0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.72], [3, 0.72, 1.22]]}, {"text": "The question is not if, but how disruptive it is when it happens.", "block": 61, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ff242b00a3e6c094dc5ab25287eec0307f35e3940f089c3808859b0aa857acf7.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 0.82], [4, 0.82, 1.14], [5, 1.48, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 1.72], [7, 1.72, 2.08], [8, 2.08, 2.38], [9, 2.38, 2.52], [10, 2.52, 2.66], [11, 2.66, 2.82], [12, 2.82, 3.1]]}, {"text": "This system minimizes blast radius:", "block": 62, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/410f785b0fb78a70320fbdbedbdccb80ba04fa390e7da9102af6482149b13c13.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 1.04], [3, 1.04, 1.4], [4, 1.4, 1.88]]}, {"text": "Losing a device does not expose passwords", "block": 63, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/30cdd31c11793b9db1f8dda8591a5a4edbe780dd1d3ff692703007b358b668de.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.38, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 0.98], [4, 0.98, 1.16], [5, 1.16, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 1.98]]}, {"text": "Losing a phone number does not lock me out", "block": 64, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/79f8cd5c8fb40f9b01f14d6957459342248680da170a7d5fabaf5af2234a856e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.42], [2, 0.58, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.4], [5, 1.4, 1.64], [6, 1.64, 1.9], [7, 1.9, 2.12], [8, 2.12, 2.34]]}, {"text": "Losing an email provider does not strand my accounts", "block": 65, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ebf39c77e3e433cee77b4b78b84d84490939f1d5b7ad4b6bb5005378349cc012.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.26], [4, 1.26, 1.56], [5, 1.56, 1.76], [7, 2.12, 2.3], [8, 2.3, 2.68]]}, {"text": "A single breach does not compromise everything", "block": 66, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a9638f51e3dda9631045de8bcae48c80817aac6101db9f00b20f3baa8ce63d9f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 0.98], [4, 0.98, 1.18], [5, 1.18, 1.66], [6, 1.66, 2.32]]}, {"text": "Security should reduce stress, not add to it.", "block": 67, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a8937bac4c50dc3c9eb84a7e3827ab77b931f1f4a5e9b7dcbba51c1f96c654cf.mp3", "words": [[2, 0.68, 1.02], [3, 1.02, 1.54], [4, 1.78, 2.0], [5, 2.0, 2.26], [6, 2.26, 2.5], [7, 2.5, 2.74]]}, {"text": "Final Thoughts", "block": 68, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/822d46e9ecc1904813a328cc457c0d27cc9944d365ce32655b814ebd4c40573a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.9]]}, {"text": "I didn’t arrive at this setup by reading blogs.", "block": 69, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6548dbc1ec90222ecfafff2fc7efc506fd798aef35ba6651597bbb34c5833537.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 0.92], [5, 1.02, 1.34], [6, 1.34, 1.56], [7, 1.56, 1.82], [8, 1.82, 2.16]]}, {"text": "I arrived at it through experience.", "block": 69, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6a225e21b9ab4cdbb40dcfa11c69642392627af9b07aa4f0a6ddae4119d92495.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 1.06], [5, 1.06, 1.8]]}, {"text": "I’ve traveled to over 60 countries.", "block": 70, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7df4391ed87664152940b4fb4c024eb279e946d924fceabc02d6d0734b82a333.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.98]]}, {"text": "In that time, I’ve seen a lot and I’ve had my share of things go wrong.", "block": 70, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5722f8bacbb3b44525f03e886ddbd59327d1cad6781edf09c0d881a1a6c0d7c3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.74], [3, 1.34, 1.58], [4, 1.58, 1.8], [5, 1.8, 1.94], [6, 1.94, 2.12], [7, 2.12, 2.4], [8, 2.4, 2.62], [9, 2.62, 2.72], [10, 2.72, 2.9], [11, 2.9, 3.12], [12, 3.12, 3.28], [13, 3.28, 3.46], [14, 3.46, 3.72], [15, 3.72, 3.98]]}, {"text": "I’ve been mugged twice.", "block": 70, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b05429f6cf4877c652e40b0482c5c7df3b5dcdc62437f2ca637988b1a0fe0a4e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.86], [3, 0.86, 1.28]]}, {"text": "My phone has been stolen three times.", "block": 70, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/17e1c393c568a6c66f8b5df06d81f30a4f6d52d060d2799cd59448d1cc4469fc.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 0.8], [4, 0.8, 1.16], [5, 1.16, 1.46], [6, 1.46, 1.92]]}, {"text": "Sometimes it was taken straight out of my pocket.", "block": 70, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/abc58cf23d5e22ec17f34b98a11bf60dfdecdb87930b62f1cfde0318e5be0273.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.42], [1, 0.42, 0.66], [2, 0.66, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.06], [4, 1.06, 1.44], [5, 1.44, 1.68], [6, 1.68, 1.76], [7, 1.76, 1.92], [8, 1.92, 2.26]]}, {"text": "Other times it was snatched directly from my hand.", "block": 70, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e38a45d3efea12e46ad3fdb362642858441a209f24a6d1c3bcf02a96196a1231.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.62], [2, 0.62, 0.76], [3, 0.76, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.64], [6, 1.64, 2.08], [7, 2.08, 2.28], [8, 2.28, 2.74]]}, {"text": "What surprised me most wasn’t how fast it happened, I always knew within a few seconds that my phone was gone, but how inevitable it felt once it did.", "block": 71, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f01a6d3227bc7401e5b12d9410554775590ad8eb9a88aa16f9ec0eb82e54c271.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.18, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.86], [3, 0.86, 1.18], [4, 1.18, 1.64], [5, 1.64, 1.78], [6, 1.78, 2.14], [7, 2.14, 2.34], [8, 2.34, 2.64], [9, 3.1, 3.36], [10, 3.36, 3.66], [11, 3.66, 3.96], [12, 3.96, 4.22], [13, 4.22, 4.34], [14, 4.34, 4.5], [15, 4.5, 4.9], [16, 4.9, 5.12], [17, 5.12, 5.26], [18, 5.26, 5.48], [19, 5.48, 5.68], [20, 5.68, 5.92], [21, 6.38, 6.52], [22, 6.52, 6.7], [23, 6.7, 7.04], [24, 7.04, 7.34], [25, 7.34, 7.56], [26, 7.56, 7.84], [27, 7.84, 8.04], [28, 8.04, 8.26]]}, {"text": "The people who do this are very good at it.", "block": 71, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3965d5f719909aa1d98239952bdd36c9b96481c93c5d4de10b8243ea747dae3c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 0.84], [4, 0.84, 1.12], [5, 1.12, 1.38], [6, 1.38, 1.82], [7, 1.82, 2.06], [8, 2.06, 2.24], [9, 2.24, 2.46]]}, {"text": "Once the phone is in their hands, it’s gone.", "block": 71, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/afcdfe204b52aee52cd41b5283facd36d45feaf8533e5c0246567e99a5aaf135.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.72], [4, 0.72, 0.8], [5, 0.8, 0.92], [6, 0.92, 1.22], [7, 1.46, 1.64], [8, 1.64, 1.84]]}, {"text": "There’s no chasing it down, no heroic recovery story.", "block": 71, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2562f9542f859b7aea06ab1c2b1d4186327b1fc1b2573b976c9fdd86b15b1dfe.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.76], [3, 0.76, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.24], [5, 1.62, 1.72], [6, 1.72, 2.22], [7, 2.22, 2.7], [8, 2.7, 3.16]]}, {"text": "That reality fundamentally shapes how I think about security.", "block": 72, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/70eb900169cc5cef190da549f49aa0ae107a796135007dd0f0429f4a393ef776.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.64], [2, 0.64, 1.08], [3, 1.08, 1.6], [4, 1.6, 1.86], [5, 1.86, 1.96], [6, 1.96, 2.16], [7, 2.16, 2.38], [8, 2.38, 2.94]]}, {"text": "Losing a phone already sucks.", "block": 73, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2655ae0542a0f52576ede8da205d0b06104f2317b1676e1ef429cf2dc432975f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 1.06], [4, 1.06, 1.5]]}, {"text": "Losing access to your money, your identity, or your accounts on top of that is far worse.", "block": 73, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6e120b192ad151f8a435fe0b45869407281b934e5cea08141f6a6ac4303bf2b2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.68], [2, 0.68, 0.9], [3, 0.9, 1.02], [4, 1.02, 1.26], [5, 1.66, 1.76], [6, 1.76, 2.24], [7, 2.6, 2.8], [8, 2.8, 3.04], [9, 3.04, 3.38], [10, 3.38, 3.56], [11, 3.56, 3.72], [12, 3.72, 3.9], [13, 3.9, 4.14], [15, 4.56, 4.78], [16, 4.78, 5.04]]}, {"text": "I don’t want my financial life to be fragile—dependent on a single device, a single phone number, or a single company’s fraud system making the right decision at the right time.", "block": 73, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/dc41e5bf632ff76d3db5bdd1c9ce7e65af3daab10566f2be00efacd172a1b077.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 0.7], [4, 0.7, 1.08], [5, 1.08, 1.46], [6, 1.46, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 1.82], [9, 2.68, 3.1], [10, 3.1, 3.22], [11, 3.22, 3.42], [12, 3.42, 3.82], [13, 4.4, 4.54], [14, 4.54, 4.78], [15, 4.78, 5.02], [16, 5.02, 5.4], [17, 5.4, 5.66], [18, 5.66, 5.8], [19, 5.8, 6.0], [20, 6.0, 6.62], [21, 6.62, 6.8], [22, 6.8, 7.32], [23, 7.32, 7.72], [24, 7.72, 7.94], [25, 7.94, 8.08], [26, 8.08, 8.52], [27, 8.52, 8.66], [28, 8.66, 8.78], [29, 8.78, 8.94], [30, 8.94, 9.38]]}, {"text": "Fortunately, despite all of that travel and all of those incidents, I’ve never had a serious account security issue.", "block": 74, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c59cc844c724060a987681d5f4b0d00960e9b44faffa73b08ebc5496beea9f39.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.62], [1, 1.12, 1.42], [2, 1.42, 1.84], [3, 1.84, 2.02], [4, 2.02, 2.2], [5, 2.2, 2.6], [6, 2.6, 2.9], [7, 2.9, 3.12], [8, 3.12, 3.32], [9, 3.32, 3.48], [10, 3.48, 3.98], [11, 4.42, 4.72], [12, 4.72, 4.9], [13, 4.9, 5.12], [14, 5.12, 5.22], [15, 5.22, 5.64], [16, 5.64, 6.02], [17, 6.02, 6.54], [18, 6.54, 6.9]]}, {"text": "I’ve never had my finances compromised.", "block": 74, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/53426630af7f57ca411f5a17ec94b053d1e681760df0e0df2bc26b2ddf4d26bb.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 0.84], [4, 0.84, 1.26], [5, 1.26, 1.88]]}, {"text": "I’ve never been locked out of critical accounts at the worst possible moment.", "block": 74, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ebeff91e841a1fae2f535ee81a0dacdbc58a892605b39067914555dd035375b9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.84], [4, 0.84, 1.04], [5, 1.04, 1.16], [6, 1.16, 1.42], [7, 1.42, 1.82], [8, 1.82, 2.04], [9, 2.04, 2.16], [10, 2.16, 2.4], [11, 2.4, 2.92], [12, 2.92, 3.32]]}, {"text": "And I’d like to keep it that way.", "block": 74, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6cafe6b22cc67bfbdefd9ff580d4ad00e30fa3c04334e8cd8ad5c7c83d059b3c.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.26, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 0.76], [4, 0.76, 0.94], [5, 0.94, 1.06], [6, 1.06, 1.22], [7, 1.22, 1.42]]}, {"text": "Good personal security isn’t about paranoia.", "block": 75, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b8e59c59c24ebd1215854ba2d79513b681e4a4a958b23895c482f577bb4ebc21.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.64], [2, 0.64, 1.16], [3, 1.16, 1.56], [4, 1.56, 1.74], [5, 1.74, 2.42]]}, {"text": "It’s about designing your digital life so that when something goes wrong—and eventually, something will—it’s an inconvenience, not a disaster.", "block": 75, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6982604581751a5a61821439057c5152789c1a0bb421f504559072be27d2e012.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.92], [3, 0.92, 1.08], [4, 1.08, 1.32], [5, 1.32, 1.62], [6, 1.62, 1.86], [7, 1.86, 1.96], [8, 1.96, 2.1], [9, 2.1, 2.42], [10, 2.42, 2.66], [12, 3.4, 4.08], [13, 4.54, 4.76], [15, 5.18, 5.24], [16, 5.24, 6.06], [17, 6.18, 6.34], [18, 6.34, 6.46], [19, 6.46, 6.9]]}]}